      "block_type": "cross_link",
      "heading": "",
      "text": "Compare soil, weather, labour and cost records for the same production period. Mixing a wet-season yield with a different year’s expenditure can create an apparent relationship that the matched evidence does not support. Record crop, area, dates and units before interpreting the apparent difference or proposing a change to farming practice.",
